Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:43.31,SCREEN,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(90,870)}希望主人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:43.31,SCREEN,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(90,930)}能夠健康度過每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:43.31,SCREEN,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(90,990)}請幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:43.31,SCREEN,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(90,1050)}實現這個願望吧。
